1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,360
I asked my wife

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,439
out with eleven

3
00:00:02,439 --> 00:00:04,059
cents in my pocket,

4
00:00:04,059 --> 00:00:05,839
a dime and a penny.

5
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:07,500
1955.

6
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,019
She works at the bakery.

7
00:00:09,019 --> 00:00:09,720
Three weeks,

8
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,259
I buy bread every morning.

9
00:00:11,259 --> 00:00:12,820
I don't say a word.

10
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:13,539
My mother thought

11
00:00:13,539 --> 00:00:14,740
I was sick.

12
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,780
Then one day, "Angia,

13
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,179
Saturday, two o'clock.

14
00:00:18,179 --> 00:00:18,739
Can I take you

15
00:00:18,739 --> 00:00:19,260
for a soda?"

16
00:00:20,199 --> 00:00:22,199
One soda, two straws.

17
00:00:22,199 --> 00:00:22,899
I left the penny

18
00:00:22,899 --> 00:00:23,420
for a tip.

19
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,059
Sixty-five years, kid.

20
00:00:26,059 --> 00:00:27,039
It started with a day

21
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:27,640
and a time.

